[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11102.15, "timestamp": "03:05:02", "text": "我、了解我或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11104.95, "timestamp": "03:05:04", "text": "与我互动时，你或许就能明白这一点了。 所以，即使"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11109.67, "timestamp": "03:05:09", "text": "只是直播或者说任何话都风险很大。 我一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11116.15, "timestamp": "03:05:16", "text": "开口就胡说八道，太没主见了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11121.349, "timestamp": "03:05:21", "text": "这是我最糟糕的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11123.67, "timestamp": "03:05:23", "text": "事情，也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11126.15, "timestamp": "03:05:26", "text": "我最无法控制的事情，但我又必须"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11128.95, "timestamp": "03:05:28", "text": "控制它。 是的，这也是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11133.03, "timestamp": "03:05:33", "text": "我一直"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11137.19, "timestamp": "03:05:37", "text": "不想直播的原因之一，因为我会胡说八道，而"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11141.67, "timestamp": "03:05:41", "text": "我不应该那样做。 而"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11145.75, "timestamp": "03:05:45", "text": "现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11148.79, "timestamp": "03:05:48", "text": "我已经意识到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11153.269, "timestamp": "03:05:53", "text": "如果我敞开心扉，把一切都说出来，那会有多危险。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11158.504, "timestamp": "03:05:58", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "no worries bro it was just bad encounter ya learn from mistake and move one"}]